      "content": "I hear the desperation in your words and I want you to know that expressing this pain is already a sign of immense strength, not weakness. While it sounds FINAL, I am concerned enough to check with you if you are currently in immediate distress or feeling hopeless to the point where you might harm yourself. If you feel the urge to \"stop,\" please reach out to a crisis line or your local emergency services immediately, as they can provide support specifically tailored to that feeling of dread without judgment. You are not alone in this crisis, and there are people who wish to help you work through these overwhelming thoughts.",
